## super-desireds.soar -- agent-world: 2 elaborations.

## Elaborate super-desireds substate super-desireds desired -> sets desired.
sp {agent-world*elaborate*super-desireds*substate*super-desireds*desired
   :default
   (state <s> ^desireds.desired <desired>
              ^super-desireds <super-desireds>)
-->
   (<super-desireds> ^desired <desired>)
}

## Elaborate super-desireds substate desired -> sets desired.
sp {agent-world*elaborate*super-desireds*substate*desired
   :default
   (state <s> ^superstate.super-desireds.desired <desired>
              ^super-desireds <super-desireds>)
-->
   (<super-desireds> ^desired <desired>)
}
